    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 8,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们知道，对于任何一个有理数来说，数轴上总有一点和它对应. 但是反过来说不对：数轴上并不是每一个点都可以和一个有理数对应. 例如，抛物线$y=x^2$和直线$y=2$的交点的横坐标就是无理数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 201,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "每一个实数都和数轴上的一个点对应. 但是，对于实数来说，逆命题也是对的：数轴上每一个点都和某一个实数对应. 因此，可以将实数集映射到数轴上的点集，而且这个映射是可逆的.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 201,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0207#8",
        "p0208#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-44",
      "label": "图 44",
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图44",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 44",
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在图44里，数轴上指出的点的坐标分别等于$-\\sqrt{7}$，$\\sqrt{5}$，$\\frac{32}{7}$. 在实际应用时，一般都把实数表示成小数，准确到所要求的准确度. 例如，$\\frac{32}{7}\\approx4.571$（准确到0.001）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面我们来讨论求$\\sqrt{5}$的小数近似值（准确到任意准确度）的方法.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "5可以看作是$\\sqrt{5}$的平方：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$5=(\\sqrt{5})^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2^2<5<3^2$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "即　$2^2<(\\sqrt{5})^2<3^2$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2<\\sqrt{5}<3$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "（这里，我们利用了性质：如果$a$和$b$是正数，而且$a^2<b^2$，那么$a<b$.）",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们找到了两个连续的整数，而$\\sqrt{5}$在这两个整数之间（图45，а）. 2是$\\sqrt{5}$的不足近似值，而3是$\\sqrt{5}$的过剩近似值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将数轴上坐标为2和3的两点间的区间分成10等分，再从这些长度为0.1的区间中挑出包含坐标为$\\sqrt{5}$的点的一个.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 202,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0208#15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-45",
      "label": "图 45",
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图45",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 45",
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为此，我们依次将各分点的坐标2.0，2.1，2.2，…，2.9，3.0平方，直到得到大于5的数为止.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0209-02",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从上表可以看出，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2.2^2<5<2.3^2$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "即　$2.2^2<(\\sqrt{5})^2<2.3^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2.2<\\sqrt{5}<2.3$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们找到了小数点后有一个数字的两个连续的小数，而$\\sqrt{5}$在这两个小数之间（图45，б）. 2.2是$\\sqrt{5}$的不足近似值，而2.3是$\\sqrt{5}$的过剩近似值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "然后再把数轴上坐标为2.2和2.3的两点间的区间分成10等分，再用同样方法从这些长度为0.01的区间中挑出包含坐标为$\\sqrt{5}$的点的一个.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从下表可以看出，$2.23^2\\leq5<2.24^2$，即 $2.23^2<(\\sqrt{5})^2<2.24^2$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 203,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0209#12",
        "p0210#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0210-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因此，$2.23<\\sqrt{5}<2.24$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这样一来，我们又找到了小数点后有两个数字的两个连续的小数，而 $\\sqrt{5}$ 在这两个小数之间（图45，в）. $2.23$ 是 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的不足近似值，而 $2.24$ 是 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的过剩近似值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同样可以找到一个长度为 $0.001$ 且包含坐标为 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的点的区间：$2.236<\\sqrt{5}<2.237$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$2.236$ 和 $2.237$ 分别是 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的不足和过剩近似值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这种计算可以继续进行下去. 如果讨论到上面这个不等式为止，那么我们可以取左右两个数的算术平均数作为 $\\sqrt{5}$ 的近似值，得：$\\sqrt{5}=2.2365\\pm0.0005$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 204,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0210#7"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
